	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f0a497463f33c725","type":"text","text":"```json\n# schema includes cardinality\n{\n\"_id\": {\n\"$oid\": \"689c9a6a1c86e77dc1bfd35b\"\n},\n\"data\": {\n\"id\": \"e8f08a6c21e1ae5c8e261207c9045082\",\n\"label\": \"constituent_id\",\n\"be_name\": \"constituent_id\",\n\"type\": \"column\",\n\"data_type\": \"integer\",\n\"nullable\": \"true\",\n\"parent_type\": \"table\",\n\"parent_id\": \"34aff2970f6552ee316eb546c6c258ca\",\n\"parent_name\": \"_17_18to24_25packagesv2\",\n\"description\": \"\",\n\"uniqueness_ratio\": \"0 to 1\",\n\"null_proportion\": \"0 to 1\",\n\"entropy\": \"0 to log₂(N)\",\n\"alphanumeric\": \"0 to 1\"\n},\n\"embedding_input\": \"\",\n\"sample_values\": [],\n\"tags\": [],\n\"created_by\": \"demo_user\",\n\"created_at\": {\n\"$date\": \"2025-08-13T13:59:43.905Z\"\n},\n\"last_updated_by\": \"\",\n\"updated_at\": {\n\"$date\": \"2025-08-13T13:59:43.905Z\"\n},\n\"human_feedback\": [\n{\n\"user\": \"\",\n\"comment\": \"\",\n\"timestamp\": \"\"\n}\n]\n}\n```","x":1200,"y":-364,"width":760,"height":1044},
		{"id":"787abaf51f30efc1","type":"text","text":"***Absolute ranges for profiling metrics***\n\n1. Uniqueness Ratio:\n\t1. Range 0 to 1\n\t2. 0 = all values identical\n\t3. 1 = all values unique\n2. Null proportion\n\t1. Range 0 to 1\n\t2. 0 = no nulls\n\t3. 1 = all values are null\n3. Entropy\n\t1. Range 0 to log₂(N)\n\t2. where N = number of rows\n\t3. 0 = only one distinct value (no randomness)\n\t4. log₂(N) = every value unique (maximum randomness)\n4. alphanumeric\n\t1. Range 0 to 1\n\t2. 0 = none of the characters are of that type\n\t3. 1 = all characters are of that type.\n\n\n***Generation of cardinality principles:***\n\n*Uniqueness Ratio:*\n**Formula:** Number of distinct values in the column divided by the total number of records.\n**Implementation:** \n\n```sql\nCOUNT(DISTINCT column) / COUNT ( * )\n```\n\n*Null proportion:*\n**Formula:** Number of nulls in the column divided by the total number of records\n**Implementation:** \n```sql\n(COUNT(*) - COUNT(column)) / COUNT(*)\n```\n\n*Entropy:*\n**Formula:** \n**Implementation:** For each unique value, calculate its proportion, apply the entropy formula, and sum over all unique values.\n\n*Alphanumeric Detection:*\n**Logic:** Check whether column values contain both alphabetic and numeric characters.\n**Implementation:** Use regular expression to identify entries that match alphanumeric patterns, ","x":2240,"y":-364,"width":960,"height":1084},
		{"id":"35e30fd3422162c5","type":"text","text":"## Blockers :\n\n1. We are not able to infer the PK's and FK's with the metadata we have.\n2. We are not able to infer the data type, nullable, other fields with respect to column metadata.\n\n\n## Initial Assumptions :\n\n* Identifying the most accurate PK and FK depends on analysing cardinality.\n* The key measures of cardinality include \n\t* uniqueness ratio, \n\t* entropy, \n\t* null proportion and \n\t* whether the values are purely alphanumeric, etc..\n* Additional factors such as data type, sample values, and the top 3 most frequent values may also be required to determine primary and foreign keys.","x":-160,"y":-240,"width":1080,"height":640},
		{"id":"cb16865bdc388e69","type":"text","text":"\n\n```json\n# Old version schema\n{\n\"_id\": {\n\"$oid\": \"689c9a6a1c86e77dc1bfd35b\"\n},\n\"data\": {\n\"id\": \"e8f08a6c21e1ae5c8e261207c9045082\",\n\"label\": \"\",\n\"be_name\": \"constituent_id\",\n\"type\": \"column\",\n\"data_type\": \"\",\n\"nullable\": \"\",\n\"parent_type\": \"table\",\n\"parent_id\": \"34aff2970f6552ee316eb546c6c258ca\",\n\"parent_name\": \"_17_18to24_25packagesv2\",\n\"description\": \"\"\n},\n\"embedding_input\": \"\",\n\"sample_values\": [1233, 2345, 4567],\n\"tags\": [],\n\"created_by\": \"demo_user\",\n\"created_at\": {\n\"$date\": \"2025-08-13T13:59:43.905Z\"\n},\n\"last_updated_by\": \"\",\n\"updated_at\": {\n\"$date\": \"2025-08-13T13:59:43.905Z\"\n},\n\"human_feedback\": [\n{\n\"user\": \"\",\n\"comment\": \"\",\n\"timestamp\": \"\"\n}\n]\n}\n```\n\n\n\n\n","x":-1120,"y":-364,"width":760,"height":920}
